Subject: [PATCH 198/230] FIX 2: Apply spacing scale to remaining pages
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Replace Tailwind spacing utilities with design system scale
- mt-3 → mt-md, mt-4 → mt-lg, mt-5 → mt-lg, mt-6 → mt-2xl
- space-y-3 → space-y, space-y-4 → space-y-lg
- Applied to: Table, TeamPage, Onboarding, Login, NotFound pages
